And the analyst names the mood hesitant, hesitant, and so on.

6
00:00:18,750 --> 00:00:22,500
70% certain 80% pressure, and every observation traces back to a time, a line, and the voice.

7
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:26,250
Under the hood, the voice is measured, not guessed.

8
00:00:26,250 --> 00:00:30,000
Which variation and?.

9
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,025
Activity and speech rate.

10
00:00:32,025 --> 00:00:34,050
All pulled straight from the audio.

11
00:00:34,050 --> 00:00:36,075
Voice and wording fuse into one label.

12
00:00:36,075 --> 00:00:38,099
Wording can boost a confident read; never mask a weak one.
